warning[grice_rules/filter-then-length]: A filter then a length
   ┌─ src/app.gleam:11:3
   │
11 │   list.length(list.filter(ages, adult))
   │   ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ This builds a filtered list only to count it

`list.filter` builds a new list that `list.length` then walks to count.
`list.count` counts the elements that pass without building one: "Counts
the number of elements in a given list satisfying a given predicate."

Hint: Call `list.count(list, where: predicate)` in place of `list.filter`,
and drop the `list.length`.

